# Code Owners
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Global fallback - require review from core team
* @core-team

# CI/CD workflows require platform team review
.github/workflows/ @platform-team @core-team
.github/workflows/composite/ @platform-team

# Infrastructure and deployment
Dockerfile @platform-team @core-team
docker/ @platform-team
scripts/ci/ @platform-team

# Security-sensitive files
.github/dependabot.yml @platform-team @security-team
.github/CODEOWNERS @platform-team

# Database migrations require DBA review
src/solstein/migrations/ @dba-team @core-team

# API changes require architecture review
src/solstein/api/ @architect-team @core-team

# Documentation
docs/ @docs-team @core-team
*.md @docs-team @core-team
